A RESOLUTION TO APPOINT THE TOWN MAYOR OF THE TOWN OF CLERMONT, GEORGIA TO BE THE ZONING OFFICIAL FOR THE TOWN OF CLERMONT, GEORGIA, AND TO PERFORM THE DUTIES OF THE ZONING OFFICIAL AS PROVIDED BY THE ZONING ORDINANCE FOR THE TOWN OF CLERMONT, GEORGIA, AS AMENDED; TO PROVIDE THAT THE ZONING OFFICIAL CAN DELIGATE CERTAIN DUTIES OF THE ZONING OFFICIAL TO APPROPRIATE STAFF AND PERSONNEL OF THE TOWN OF CLERMONT, GEORGIA; TO PROVIDE THAT THE ZONING OFFICIAL HAS THE FULL AND COMPLETE AUTHORITY TO CONSULT WITH THE TOWN ENGINEER, THE TOWN ATTORNEY, AND OTHER PROFESSIONALS, AS NEEDED, IN THE PERFORMANCE OF THE DUTIES OF THE ZONING OFFICIAL; AND FOR OTHER PURPOSES.

WHEREAS, the Town Council of the Town of Clermont, Georgia is authorized by Article IV, Section II, Paragraph IV of the Constitution of the State of Georgia of 1983, as amended, O.C.G.A. §§ 36-66-1, et seq. and the Town Charter, to exercise its police power to enact land use regulations, including, but not limited to, zoning regulations, as to property within the Town of Clermont, Georgia;

WHEREAS, the Town of Clermont, by and through the Town Council of the Town of Clermont, Georgia, has enacted a Zoning Ordinance for the Town of Clermont, Georgia, as amended, and which provides certain land use regulations as to property within the Town of Clermont, Georgia;

WHEREAS, the Zoning Ordinance of the Town of Clermont, Georgia provides for the position of a zoning official for the Town of Clermont, Georgia, and authorizes the zoning official

to perform certain administrative duties regarding land use and as provided by the Zoning Ordinance of the Town of Clermont, Georgia;

WHEREAS, the Town Council finds that it is appropriate, and necessary for the health, public interest, safety and welfare of the Town of Clermont, that the Town Mayor for the Town of Clermont, Georgia, be designated as the zoning official for the Town of Clermont, Georgia, and perform the duties of the zoning official for the Town of Clermont, Georgia as provided under the Zoning Ordinance for the Town of Clermont, Georgia; and

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED by the Town Council of Clermont, Georgia, and it is hereby resolved by the above-referenced authority, as follows:
